docs/model-architecture.md:739:- **Critic:** `critic_head = OutputProjectionMLP(trunk_config, 1)`, applied to the two critic-value tokens (self, opponent), gives one logit per player and a softmax winner distribution. `compute_value` returns `2·p(self) − 1` per seat (`win_loss`), and `winner_log_probabilities` returns `[env, seat, 2]`. Its output layer uses Isaiah's critic gain 1.0.
